<title>USA: AG Associates names Johnson CFO.</title>
<headline>AG Associates names Johnson CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>AG Associates said Wednesday it appointed Kirk Johnson as vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Prior to joining AG, Johnson was corporate controller for Cypress Semiconductor.</p>
<p>Johnson replaces Dennis Favero, who recently left the company to pursue other interests.</p>
